      'Scoring example: Points are awarded for: each King captured (1 point), the 7 of Coins (1 point), capturing the majority of cards (1 point), and each sweep/scopa (1 point). First player to reach a target score (typically 11 or 21 points) wins, or highest score when stock is exhausted..',
